#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:5
#: ed0055e7018f460f91d3dc6665bf2f78
msgid "PWM, OneShot and OneShot125 ESCs"
msgstr "PWM、OneShot和OneShot125 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:7
#: 07caf1d10f1c4ed580a573661b61737a
msgid ""
"Most ArduPilot vehicles use brushless motors controlled by brushless motor "
"ESCs. The most common protocols used by these ESCs are PWM, OneShot, "
"OneShot125, and :ref:`DShot <common-dshot-escs>`. This page describes the "
"first three (PWM, OneShot and OneShot125)."
msgstr ""
"大多数ArduPilot飞行器使用无刷电机，由无刷电机ESC控制。这些ESC最常用的协议是PWM、OneShot、OneShot125和 "
":ref:`DShot <common-dshot-escs>`。本页介绍前三种（PWM、OneShot和OneShot125）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:9
#: fc52dade6f7a4934b1e5c3ffd787d162
msgid ""
"Be sure your ESC can support the configuration you select for it. Damage can"
" occur otherwise. This includes frame rates discussed below. Also be careful"
" when switching between protocols without rebooting or re-calibrating ESCs "
"as this can lead to uncommanded motor output."
msgstr "请确保您的ESC支持所选配置，否则可能造成损坏。这包括下文讨论的帧率。在不重启或重新校准ESC的情况下切换协议，可能导致电机意外输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:12
#: 08c3870367e64185ae5573ad1dc43694
msgid "PWM"
msgstr "PWM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:13
#: 6fef1f0fe86444e3b22dacd4599d6a54
msgid ""
"These are the most common ESCs for non-copter applications and were "
"historically the first brushless ESCs."
msgstr "这是非多旋翼应用中最常见的ESC类型，也是历史上最早出现的无刷ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:17
#: acb8eb0f00fc4bf8aaa4a2821cdb58e9
msgid ""
"PWM ESCs use a periodic input pulse of width typically between 1000uS and "
"2000uS for zero to full power, respectively."
msgstr "PWM ESC使用脉冲宽度为1000uS到2000uS的周期输入脉冲，分别对应零功率和全功率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:22
#: c6225a0c19d74ab1827262ce6e3c90e7
msgid ""
"Forward motors will use normal PWM unless OneShot (see below) or :ref:`DShot"
" <common-dshot-escs>` has been enabled.  The PWM range for each channel is "
"specified by the corresponding :ref:`SERVOx_MIN <SERVO3_MIN>` and "
":ref:`SERVOx_MAX <SERVO3_MAX>` parameters."
msgstr ""
"前向电机将使用普通 PWM，除非启用了 OneShot（见下文）或 :ref:`DShot <common-dshot-escs>`。每个通道的 PWM"
" 范围由相应的 :ref:`SERVOx_MIN <SERVO3_MIN>` 和 :ref:`SERVOx_MAX <SERVO3_MAX>` "
"参数指定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:23
#: 3411370d1b01427ea41de8a61d2dcc07
msgid ""
"VTOL motors will use normal PWM when :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE <Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` is "
"0/Normal (the default).  The PWM range is specified by the :ref:`Q_M_PWM_MIN"
" <Q_M_PWM_MIN>` and :ref:`Q_M_PWM_MAX <Q_M_PWM_MAX>` parameters"
msgstr ""
"当 :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE <Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` 为 0/普通（默认）时，VTOL 电机将使用普通 PWM。PWM 范围由 "
":ref:`Q_M_PWM_MIN <Q_M_PWM_MIN>` 和 :ref:`Q_M_PWM_MAX <Q_M_PWM_MAX>` 参数指定"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:24
#: 618d18d5c9814463b93efd2e0d95887d
msgid ""
"See :ref:`ESC Calibration <common-esc-calibration>` for info on aligning the"
" autopilot's output range with the ESC's input range."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :ref:`ESC 校准 <common-esc-calibration>` 了解如何将飞控输出范围与 ESC 输入范围对齐的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:26
#: 1e6d90d950f64cdcbcbd3aeb36836a6b
msgid "The autopilot should be re-booted after changing the protocol type."
msgstr "更改协议类型后应重新启动飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:29
#: fb2a2e7cca7b47d28ac9d3484e298e69
msgid ""
"The frame rate of these pulses is usually between 50Hz to 490Hz. The faster "
"frame rates allow quicker control reactions to be sent to the motor, if the "
"ESC has capability for those frame rates."
msgstr "这些脉冲的帧率通常在50Hz到490Hz之间。若ESC支持更高帧率，则更快的帧率可向电机发送更快速的控制响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:34
#: 347e9932c1954cde8745b3381c47a928
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERVO_RATE <SERVO_RATE>` to change the frame rate for forward "
"motors (default is 50hz)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SERVO_RATE <SERVO_RATE>` 以更改前向电机的输出帧率（默认 50Hz）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:35
#: 814061fbede0440cae30a7c0ea158d26
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`Q_RC_SPEED <Q_RC_SPEED>` to change the frame rate for the VTOL "
"esc/motors (default is 490Hz)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`Q_RC_SPEED <Q_RC_SPEED>` 以更改 VTOL ESC/电机的输出帧率（默认 490Hz）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:38
#: fe7179288404480ba44324e1a9a376e2
msgid ""
"be sure of the capabilities of your ESC before selecting a higher frame rate"
" to avoid damage to the ESC."
msgstr "请在选择更高帧率前确认您的ESC支持该帧率，以免损坏ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:41
#: 04e6e8b4cb8b4f2f95be419e5225c2a0
msgid "OneShot"
msgstr "OneShot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:43
#: 992ec5003aef4b5e8607307771dbb0cb
msgid ""
"OneShot (not to be confused with \"OneShot125\") is an older protocol that "
"uses the same pulse widths as Normal PWM but has a fixed frame rate equal to"
" the autopilot main loop rate.  There is little advantage for using this "
"protocol over regular PWM."
msgstr ""
"OneShot（不要与 「OneShot125」 "
"混淆）是一种较旧的协议，使用与普通PWM相同的脉冲宽度，但帧率固定等于飞控主循环频率。相比普通PWM，使用此协议的优势很小。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:47
#: 4c070524959e4d83903076604c8347e2
msgid ""
"Oneshot (not Oneshot125) loop synchronization can be added to any motor "
"running an normal PWM ESC or servo using the :ref:`ONESHOT_MASK "
"<ONESHOT_MASK>` bitmask. It will trigger pulses at the :ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE"
" <SCHED_LOOP_RATE>`, but no lower than at 250Hz. Be sure the ESCs can handle"
" this rate."
msgstr ""
"OneShot（非 OneShot125）循环同步可以使用 :ref:`ONESHOT_MASK <ONESHOT_MASK>` "
"位掩码添加到任何运行普通 PWM ESC 或舵机的电机上。它将在 :ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE <SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` "
"下触发脉冲，但不低于 250Hz。确保 ESC 能处理此速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:49
#: 8b09c4abce50411b9db88bd2988f68a5
msgid ""
"VTOL motors will use OneShot if :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE <Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` is 1 "
"(OneShot)"
msgstr "如果 :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE <Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` 为 1（OneShot），VTOL 电机将使用 OneShot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:53
#: 097f6e45b45343f39a64ede4403934af
msgid "OneShot 125"
msgstr "OneShot 125"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:55
#: ff5f1ffbebe244bf9482fe8a0f0c606d
msgid ""
"The OneShot125 (sometimes confusingly shortened to just OneShot) protocol is"
" similar to regular PWM except that the pulse widths are divided by a factor"
" of 8 which allows faster communication from the autopilot to the ESC.  "
"Individual pulses are sent more quickly and the overall frame rate can be "
"increased up to 490Hz."
msgstr ""
"OneShot125（有时被混淆地简称为OneShot）协议与普通PWM类似，但脉冲宽度缩小为原来的八分之一，从而实现飞控到ESC的更快通信。单个脉冲发送更快，整体帧率可提高至490Hz。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:59
#: 897ba1452f944a439fcad3ef51aade53
msgid ""
"Forward motors will use normal PWM unless OneShot or DShot has been enabled "
"(see below)"
msgstr "除非启用了 OneShot 或 DShot，否则前向电机将使用普通 PWM（见下文）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:60
#: f18d3aa204b34128bc1d324a5be1ae79
msgid ""
"VTOL motors will use OneShot125 if :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE <Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` is 2 "
"(OneShot125)"
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE <Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` 为 2（OneShot125），VTOL 电机将使用 OneShot125"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:63
#: 1e6f57957b3b4452bbb7bccc0fd1f4e7
msgid ""
"If using an autopilot with an IOMCU (e.g. Pixhawk, CubeOrange) the ESCs "
"should be connected to the AUX outputs and the corresponding "
":ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` values should be set to \"Motor1\","
" etc.  This can be most easily done using Mission Planner's \"Servo Output\""
" page"
msgstr ""
"若使用带IOMCU的飞控（如Pixhawk、CubeOrange），ESC应连接至AUX输出，并将相应的 :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO9_FUNCTION>` 值设置为 「Motor1」 等。可在Mission Planner的「舵机输出」页面轻松完成此操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:67
#: d49a5ab79416498aad26529e803159df
msgid ""
"Reboot the autopilot and check the \"RC banner\" to confirm the output "
"channels are setup as expected (this banner appears whenever parameters are "
"downloaded)"
msgstr "重启飞控并检查「RC banner」以确认输出通道配置符合预期（此banner在下载参数时出现）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:74
#: 7fa1332a37b24ad09411a2ce6d471e0e
msgid "Mixing ESC Protocols"
msgstr "混用ESC协议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:76
#: 8af0d102a0ca4db99d8bd9bd2cdbd0ec
msgid ""
"While all the servo/motor outputs of an ArduPilot autopilot are capable of "
"Normal PWM operation at 50Hz frame rates, not all are capable of other ESC "
"protocols. And, usually, these configurations must apply to pre-designated "
"groups of outputs, even if they are not all driving an ESC. So the following"
" cautions apply:"
msgstr ""
"虽然ArduPilot飞控的所有舵机/电机输出均能以50Hz帧率进行普通PWM操作，但并非所有输出都支持其他ESC协议。通常，这些配置必须应用于预先指定的输出组，即使该组中并非所有输出都连接了ESC。因此需注意以下事项："

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:78
#: b8b9c43668074eafb9ef4a3458c2699e
msgid ""
"The 8 \"MAIN\" outputs of autopilots using an IOMCU (like PixHawk and Cube),"
" cannot be used for  protocols other than Normal PWM and OneShot. On these "
"autopilots, only the additional \"AUX\" outputs can properly support "
"OneShot125. If you attempt to set a \"MAIN\" output to OneShot125, then "
"normal PWM output will occur, even though it has been set to a OneShot125 "
"protocol."
msgstr ""
"使用IOMCU的飞控（如PixHawk和Cube）的8个「MAIN」输出，除普通PWM和OneShot外，不能用于其他协议。在这些飞控上，只有额外的「AUX」输出才能正常支持OneShot125。若尝试将「MAIN」输出设置为OneShot125，实际上仍会输出普通PWM，即使已设置为OneShot125协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:80
#: 2a659b256a9b4cabaadab648056eaba3
msgid ""
"For :ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>` and :ref:`other boards "
"<common-autopilots>` without a separate IOMCU coprocessor, all servo/motor "
"outputs can be used."
msgstr ""
"对于 :ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>` 和其他没有独立 IOMCU 协处理器的 :ref:`飞控 "
"<common-autopilots>`，所有舵机/电机输出均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:82
#: dc6999e72d75443c93eef36e62006e79
msgid ""
"Groups of outputs sharing a common timer, MUST have the same advanced "
"configuration. Usually, these are specified in the autopilot's hardware "
"description linked from the :ref:`common-autopilots` page. For example, if "
"an output is configured for OneShot125 in a group, then you cannot use "
"another output in that group for Normal PWM ESC **or** normal PWM servo "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"共享同一定时器的输出组，必须使用相同的高级配置。通常在 :ref:`common-autopilots` "
"页面链接的飞控硬件说明中有所指定。例如，若某组中某输出配置为OneShot125，则该组中的其他输出不能用于普通PWM ESC **或** "
"普通PWM舵机操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:84
#: b9879b6b22684f9f91158b027bb02b7c
msgid ""
"Everytime the autopilot initializes, it sends the \"RC Banner\" to the "
"ground control station, showing which outputs are PWM, OneShot, OneShot125 "
"or DShot. The remaining higher numbered outputs are assigned as GPIOs."
msgstr ""
"每次飞控初始化时，都会向地面站发送「RC "
"Banner」，显示哪些输出为PWM、OneShot、OneShot125或DShot。编号较高的剩余输出分配为GPIO。"

